Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.10,0:00:04.19,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Is that actually "love"?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.26,0:00:11.86,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,But isn't this "experiment" \Nto figure that out?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.34,0:00:14.36,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,B-But...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.79,0:00:18.69,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Now, now. Let's just chill \Nand take it easy, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.22,0:00:22.83,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh, right. I have something you'll like.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.83,0:00:23.97,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.18,0:00:31.11,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I mean, you haven't even \Nsaid, "I like you" yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.58,0:00:33.67,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.14,0:00:38.06,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.93,0:00:40.81,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Her face just now...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.60,0:00:44.04,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,was priceless.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.16,0:00:52.69,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,It's probably because of...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.40,0:00:55.91,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,yesterday's date.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.63,0:00:58.87,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,No, was it the nurse's office?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.89,0:01:02.04,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,No, before then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.33,0:01:03.23,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Why...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.61,0:01:08.04,flashback italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,We often know ourselves the least.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.89,0:01:13.42,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,It's almost like...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.51,0:01:18.71,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I {\i0}want{\i1} Senpai to fall in love with me.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.48,0:02:55.82,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs16\bord2.5\b1\c&H7E05D0&\3c&H22F9EB&\frz339.1\pos(402,113.334)\frx8\fry354}Choco Anpan
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.48,0:02:55.82,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord4\fs16\b1\c&H7E05D0&\3c&H1B99D8&\frz339.1\pos(402,113.334)\frx8\fry354}Choco Anpan
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.55,0:02:55.82,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Is this yours, Ichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.05,0:02:57.72,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,You don't usually carry \Nsweets around, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.05,0:02:58.96,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.96,0:03:00.78,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,What? Is it for the Prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.78,0:03:03.03,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yeah. But I don't need it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.82,0:03:06.71,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,It really isn't like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.71,0:03:09.87,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,To think Ichi was going to \Ngive something {\i1}this{\i0} cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.55,0:03:13.08,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,I asked you this before...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.75,0:03:15.81,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,but why are you so into her?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.94,0:03:21.72,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Her face?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.72,0:03:23.51,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,I was the dumbass for asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.30,0:03:31.19,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I don't know why,\Nbut I always want to look at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.99,0:03:34.15,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,And when I do, I can't \Nstop looking at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.51,0:03:37.32,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,But I don't know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.42,0:03:42.34,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I think even if Yoi-chan were a man, \NI would feel the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.50,0:03:44.35,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,C'mon, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.35,0:03:45.49,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Uh, what do you call it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.49,0:03:49.05,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I'm like a Yoi-chan enthusiast, \Nor a fanatic or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.05,0:03:53.17,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Y'know, I've been thinking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.12,0:03:56.88,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Isn't that what people \Ncall love at first sight?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.69,0:04:00.85,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,And an intense case, at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.73,0:04:05.43,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.43,0:04:07.13,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Oh, is that not it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.13,0:04:09.10,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,I always thought that's what it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.39,0:04:11.35,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Because if you can't\Nkeep your eyes off her,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.36,0:04:13.66,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,it's gotta be love.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.88,0:04:16.75,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Love.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.15,0:04:19.48,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Huh? Seriously? What part?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.78,0:04:21.97,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Am I really gushing to you \Nguys all the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.30,0:04:27.50,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,More like leaving us on read. And unread. \NAnd generally ignoring us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.50,0:04:28.99,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,What I'm saying is,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.29,0:04:32.91,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,the way you're treating her is totally \Ndifferent from the girls you've dated.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.91,0:04:35.90,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,So I thought this time you \Nmight seriously be in love, Ichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.90,0:04:37.93,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Huh? Seriously in love?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.90,0:04:40.30,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,How can you tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.30,0:04:46.17,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,I mean, even I don't \Nknow that much about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.17,0:04:49.69,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,You could probably figure it out \Nif you gave it a little thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.69,0:04:51.30,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,What kind of clueless Prince are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.30,0:05:02.74,flashback,YOI,0,0,0,,{\fade(0,100)}I mean, you haven't even \Nsaid, "I like you" yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.74,0:05:03.44,flashback,YOI,0,0,0,,{\fade(100,100)}I mean, you haven't even \Nsaid, "I like you" yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.44,0:05:04.15,flashback,YOI,0,0,0,,{\fade(100,100)}I mean, you haven't even \Nsaid, "I like you" yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.15,0:05:04.63,flashback,YOI,0,0,0,,{\fade(100,100)}I mean, you haven't even \Nsaid, "I like you" yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.63,0:05:07.50,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Why did I say {\i0}that{\i1}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.50,0:05:09.50,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I want to find a hole and crawl into it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.95,0:05:13.79,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I wonder what Senpai\Nthought when I said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.18,0:05:17.46,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,It's not like that's even what I \Nwanted to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.22,0:05:20.90,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Why can't I ever be honest?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.70,0:05:25.17,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I could have said something \Na little cuter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.33,0:05:28.82,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I mean, because I'm a girl, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.82,0:05:30.76,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,No deeper meaning behind it than that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.30,0:05:40.15,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, when I see him, \NI'll properly apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.92,0:05:43.78,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Yoi-chan, let's go buy some juice!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.40,0:05:52.79,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,I'm so sleepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.15,0:05:58.79,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,H-How strange...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.71,0:06:02.38,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,He hasn't randomly showed up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.82,0:06:04.35,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Yoi-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.35,0:06:05.81,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.44,0:06:12.27,Default,BOY 1,0,0,0,,Hey, wasn't expecting you to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.75,0:06:14.85,Default,BOY 1,0,0,0,,Ichi in the classroom during lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.17,0:06:16.57,Default,BOY 1,0,0,0,,Hey, wanna shoot some hoops?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.57,0:06:18.38,Default,GIRL 1,0,0,0,,We'll cheer you on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.38,0:06:20.43,Default,GIRL 2,0,0,0,,You're really good at \Nbasketball, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.43,0:06:22.43,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh, for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.43,0:06:25.15,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,But my leg has been acting \Nup since yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.42,0:06:27.37,Default,GIRL 1,0,0,0,,Huh? Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.37,0:06:29.03,Default,PLUMP BOY,0,0,0,,Hey, Ichimura!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.59,0:06:32.45,Default,PLUMP BOY,0,0,0,,There's a first-year here for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.71,0:06:38.38,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Huh? The Prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.18,0:06:41.88,Default,GIRL 2,0,0,0,,What about his leg?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.20,0:06:43.07,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yoi-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.53,0:06:44.77,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.77,0:06:45.92,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What's goin' on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.92,0:06:48.89,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Uh, well, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.89,0:06:50.13,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.84,0:06:51.54,Default,STUDENTS,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.54,0:06:52.46,Default,STUDENTS,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.46,0:06:53.84,Default,STUDENTS,0,0,0,,Can it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.84,0:06:55.59,Default,STUDENTS,0,0,0,,Aren't they always together?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.62,0:06:57.46,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.82,0:07:04.19,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,So? What did you want to see me for?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.94,0:07:09.75,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I thought you might be feeling bothered \Nabout what I said yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.17,0:07:16.10,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.55,0:07:20.29,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Nah, I'm not bothered at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.58,0:07:21.21,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.12,0:07:25.85,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Is that... so?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.17,0:07:28.09,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,That's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.76,0:07:31.22,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Why did that hit me so hard?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.74,0:07:38.93,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hey, what do you wanna do about gyoza?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.50,0:07:42.64,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Gyoza? You mean from the other day?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.95,0:07:46.18,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yeah. We weren't able to go, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.67,0:07:49.71,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I've been craving gyoza ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.21,0:07:51.82,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I know that feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.82,0:07:52.49,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.88,0:07:56.45,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,So, I figured we could go somewhere close.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.55,0:07:59.29,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,You mean... you and me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.29,0:08:00.74,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Uh, Who else is here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.74,0:08:01.16,italics,Gyoza,0,0,0,,Gy...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.33,0:08:01.79,italics,Gyoza,0,0,0,,Gy...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.04,0:08:02.87,italics,Gyoza,0,0,0,,Gyoza.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.87,0:08:04.71,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I-I want to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.03,0:08:06.59,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Then how about today? Are you free?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.59,0:08:08.59,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, only after work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.59,0:08:11.17,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I need to help with prep, \Nso I should be done by 7PM.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.17,0:08:13.43,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Okay. I'll hit you up later.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.30,0:08:18.58,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Ah, no way, I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.14,0:08:21.53,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,About the gyoza, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.44,0:08:27.00,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Seriously, what is this emotional \Nrollercoaster I'm on?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.86,0:08:32.07,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\t(0,4210,\fs22)\c&HA6CFEF&\fnTimes New Roman\bord0\b1\move(323.333,181.333,325.333,182.667,0,4193)\frx44\fry28\frz344.2}Chinese Cuisine
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.63,0:08:32.07,Default,STORE CLERK,0,0,0,,Welcome! How many in your party?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.32,0:08:34.28,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh, for two please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.13,0:08:37.74,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Wow, there's a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.04,0:08:39.49,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hey, this one's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.50,0:08:42.27,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I know it's a bit late to say it,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.27,0:08:45.29,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,but I don't come to places \Nlike this very often,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.29,0:08:46.53,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,so I'm a bit nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.53,0:08:47.33,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.83,0:08:49.67,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,You seem like you're used to it, Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.67,0:08:53.69,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hmm? Yeah, I can't cook at all, so.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.07,0:08:55.80,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Don't even know how to boil rice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.16,0:08:57.32,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.32,0:08:59.91,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Didn't he say he was \Nliving on his own before?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.91,0:09:02.37,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I wonder if I'm allowed \Nto ask him about that...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.85,0:09:05.56,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.89,0:09:07.77,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Ichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.07,0:09:10.29,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Ugh. The loud ones are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.29,0:09:11.57,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,What's this? What's {\i1}this{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.57,0:09:12.68,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Getting dinner {\i1}together{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.68,0:09:14.13,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,I'm so jealous!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.13,0:09:15.65,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Ah, and the yelling starts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.97,0:09:17.51,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Harsh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.51,0:09:19.57,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Hey, can we join ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.23,0:09:23.46,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,I wanted a chance to really \Ntalk to the Prince for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.46,0:09:24.06,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,No can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.81,0:09:26.54,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Could you leave us alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.54,0:09:30.34,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Look at him, treating us like \Nwe're a third wheel...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.34,0:09:33.17,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Kuwa, could you take \NSentaro away somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.17,0:09:34.31,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.42,0:09:36.17,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Wha? Aw, c'mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.47,0:09:38.03,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I've thought this before,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.03,0:09:41.89,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,but this guy can just say things\Nlike that at the drop of a hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.27,0:09:45.51,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm sure I'm the only one \Nwho keeps getting flustered.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.51,0:09:46.39,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.76,0:09:47.59,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Hey, Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.12,0:09:50.51,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Sorry for eating your Choco anpan!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.63,0:09:54.36,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Kuwa, you little...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.79,0:09:57.16,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Those guys are gonna pay for this later.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.21,0:10:00.97,Default,STORE CLERK,0,0,0,,Thank you for waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.97,0:10:03.54,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Wow, it looks delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.85,0:10:05.45,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Man, I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.33,0:10:08.03,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh, Yoi-chan, chili oil?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.03,0:10:10.00,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you very... much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.81,0:10:17.65,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,They're totally watching me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.98,0:10:19.01,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Sorry, Yoi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.83,0:10:21.05,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Could you scootch over?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.10,0:10:27.89,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Stop looking at her, dumbass.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.13,0:10:29.75,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Whoa, seriously?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.75,0:10:31.45,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,He's really done it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.90,0:10:34.52,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,He's so...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.57,0:10:36.43,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,close...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.29,0:10:40.03,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Sorry, it's a little \Ntight, but bear with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.98,0:10:43.26,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to eat gyoza like—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.11,0:10:46.20,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Is it too cramped? You good?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.79,0:10:50.29,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm fine. I'm a little nervous, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.29,0:10:53.02,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, what was I about to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.75,0:10:57.96,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Well, you know, I'm not used to \Nbeing close to a man like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.45,0:11:01.43,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm sure this is nothing \Nto you, Senpai, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.43,0:11:03.63,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Ah, I just dug my own grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.63,0:11:04.59,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I'm nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.57,0:11:09.65,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Right now, I'm nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.35,0:11:13.59,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,There you go again, \Nsaying stuff like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.59,0:11:14.98,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm not going to be fooled.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.81,0:11:16.78,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh gosh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.24,0:11:19.32,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,My heart...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.76,0:11:23.95,Default,WOMAN 1,0,0,0,,Hey, over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.24,0:11:26.88,Default,WOMAN 1,0,0,0,,There's two boys sitting close together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.88,0:11:28.97,Default,WOMAN 2,0,0,0,,Are they flirting? So cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.97,0:11:30.06,Default,WOMAN 1,0,0,0,,Right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.06,0:11:32.19,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,It's going to get cold if we don't eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.13,0:11:36.18,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,It burns...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.41,0:11:46.60,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,The gyoza was good, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.60,0:11:49.51,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,How about we go to a different \None next time?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.51,0:11:51.02,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.23,0:11:53.02,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Let's do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.02,0:11:57.06,top,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Man, I wasn't expecting \Nto see those two there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.39,0:11:57.06,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I can't remember what it tasted like.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.06,0:12:00.97,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,That joint is popular, so I \Nsee familiar faces sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.97,0:12:03.34,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,We gotta be extra careful next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.33,0:12:08.46,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Also, isn't Senpai acting normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.38,0:12:12.50,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Even after what he did to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.78,0:12:16.20,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Am I just being overly self-conscious?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.49,0:12:19.17,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.25,0:12:25.09,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I've been thinking, in my own way, \Nabout what you said yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.03,0:12:32.98,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.38,0:12:39.71,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Honestly, I still don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.82,0:12:44.67,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.78,0:12:49.88,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Why did that hit me so hard again?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.74,0:12:53.62,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,So, can I try something out?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.83,0:13:19.59,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.05,0:13:22.07,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I'm really gonna do it if we \Nstay like this any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.98,0:13:24.70,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,W-Wait a min—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.70,0:13:26.23,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh, wait, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.60,0:13:30.08,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I was just eating gyoza.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.34,0:13:33.16,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Does my breath stink?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.83,0:13:34.53,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You good?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.84,0:13:36.66,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I-I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.66,0:13:38.17,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,That was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.65,0:13:40.92,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Never mind that, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.34,0:13:43.43,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,What was I about to...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.61,0:13:48.57,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, you want some gum?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.55,0:13:51.51,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,They gave it to us at the restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.51,0:13:52.64,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.15,0:13:54.44,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,What timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.84,0:13:55.60,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,So.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.39,0:14:00.06,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Personally, I don't wanna destroy\Nthe thing we've had going.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.59,0:14:03.62,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.06,0:14:08.37,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Would it be all right if I held your hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.22,0:14:14.36,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you talking about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.36,0:14:17.24,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,We said at the start that we weren't \Ngoing to do stuff like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.24,0:14:19.86,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,But it seemed like you were okay \Nwith the kiss just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.86,0:14:23.25,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I-I just froze in place because \Nyou caught me off guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.68,0:14:28.13,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Besides, it's strange to offer your hand \Nto see if you like someone or not!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.41,0:14:29.93,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,It should be the other way around!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.43,0:14:32.57,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.65,0:14:37.23,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I've never experienced a platonic \Nrelationship like this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.72,0:14:40.34,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I need to try a bunch of tests \Nto figure out how I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.62,0:14:44.43,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,P-Platonic?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.67,0:14:47.21,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.19,0:14:49.45,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,If you don't want to, I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.18,0:14:55.67,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,But people might mistake \Nus for two guys again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.06,0:15:04.04,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I couldn't care less about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.26,0:15:15.61,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,We ended up holding hands anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.21,0:15:19.43,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Senpai's hand is hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.70,0:15:21.57,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,That was unexpected...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.95,0:15:27.82,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Is his the only hand that's hot?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.35,0:15:33.24,Default,BIG SISTER,0,0,0,,Yoi! Are you done in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.24,0:15:35.19,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I couldn't stand him at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.19,0:15:37.09,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,But before I knew it,\NI was fine with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.53,0:15:41.75,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,He's not a bad person, and it's not \Nthat I don't like him... maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.64,0:15:45.96,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm not even sure of my own feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.83,0:15:48.67,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.71,0:15:54.39,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I find myself wanting Senpai \Nto really fall in love with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.70,0:15:59.57,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Not, "You're beautiful," or,\N"I want you." Nothing like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.19,0:16:05.69,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,If he just looked me in the \Neye and said it to me, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.49,0:16:14.61,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Such a self-serving and \Nselfish way of thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.58,0:16:20.53,Default,BIG SISTER,0,0,0,,Oh, you're finally out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.53,0:16:21.79,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Sis...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.57,0:16:24.75,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.37,0:16:30.06,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Senpai's still awake, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.79,0:16:32.43,Default,BIG SISTER,0,0,0,,By the way, did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.43,0:16:36.67,Default,BIG SISTER,0,0,0,,It seems like we still haven't found \Na new part-timer, and Dad was...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.70,0:16:46.05,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Should I message him about \Nsomething that happened today?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.67,0:16:48.33,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,But what would I even say?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.40,0:16:52.27,Default,BIG SISTER,0,0,0,,Yoi, you've got a boyfriend, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.98,0:16:54.15,Default,BIG SISTER,0,0,0,,Oh, was I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.15,0:16:56.36,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,N-No, we're not going out yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.69,0:17:01.22,Default,BIG SISTER,0,0,0,,Oh? Not "yet," huh.\NThat's what I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.22,0:17:03.46,Default,BIG SISTER,0,0,0,,No wonder you're acting \Ndifferently than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.54,0:17:07.52,Default,BIG SISTER,0,0,0,,Your expression just seems \Na little more gentle...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.52,0:17:10.92,Default,BIG SISTER,0,0,0,,Or maybe you've become \Nmore emotionally expressive?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.14,0:17:15.38,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, Kotobuki and the \Nothers said something similar to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.01,0:17:18.49,Default,BIG SISTER,0,0,0,,More importantly,\Nwhat kind of person is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.27,0:17:21.39,Default,BIG SISTER,0,0,0,,What's his name?\NDo you have a picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.39,0:17:23.35,Default,BIG SISTER,0,0,0,,Which celebrity does he look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.49,0:17:29.51,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,We go to school together.\NHe's one year ahead of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.11,0:17:33.07,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,And they call him the Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.07,0:17:34.78,Default,BIG SISTER,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.21,0:17:38.81,Default,BIG SISTER,0,0,0,,There's someone besides you \Nwith that strange nickname?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.81,0:17:42.81,Default,BIG SISTER,0,0,0,,Well, it's not exactly \Nfighting poison with poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.81,0:17:44.57,Default,BIG SISTER,0,0,0,,But maybe someone more \Nprince-like than you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.57,0:17:46.75,Default,BIG SISTER,0,0,0,,might actually be a better match for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.04,0:17:49.71,Default,BIG SISTER,0,0,0,,That guy's got pretty good taste, I'd say.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.22,0:17:54.38,Default,BIG SISTER,0,0,0,,All right, Imma take a \Nbath and head right to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.03,0:17:56.93,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\b1\fs24\bord0\fade(376,0)\c&H390029&\move(550,7.333,416.667,7.333,0,376)}Gehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.38,0:17:56.93,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,He's nothing like a prince, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.46,0:17:59.18,flashback,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I couldn't care less about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.37,0:18:03.70,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Well, that was... kinda... yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.10,0:18:08.06,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\c&HFDFDF2&\bord0\fs18\frz334.8\pos(357.334,64.667)}Yoi Takiguichi
Dialogue: 1,0:18:06.10,0:18:08.06,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\an7\c&H3D3F41&\fs15\pos(15,20)}Good evening.\NThis is my first time messaging.\NIt's Takiguichi.\NAfter thinking a little on what we\Nspoke about today, I would like to \Npropose the following:\NHow about a date next Saturday \Nor Sunday?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.10,0:18:08.06,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\p1\fscy220\alpha&H20&\c&HF5F7F9&}m 0 0 l 220 0 220 57 0 57
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.10,0:18:08.06,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\p1\fscy220\alpha&H20&\c&H8EA33D&\pos(10,146.667)}m 0 0 l 45 0 45 8 0 8
Dialogue: 1,0:18:06.10,0:18:08.06,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&HFDFDF2&\bord0\fs14\3c&H8EA33E&\pos(15,148)}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.41,0:18:12.61,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,At the time...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.86,0:18:16.68,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I couldn't go through with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.81,0:18:20.76,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,'Cause I knew I wouldn't stop if I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.77,0:18:28.79,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I didn't get much sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.90,0:18:31.13,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.57,0:18:36.63,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,G-Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.63,0:18:37.76,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Thanks for yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.05,0:18:41.22,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I... can't properly look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.59,0:18:44.29,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I have something I need to attend \Nto in the staff room, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.37,0:18:47.48,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Look at her go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.78,0:18:49.84,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,The Prince is fast on her feet, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.84,0:18:51.44,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Real fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.97,0:19:01.23,top,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Hey, hey! Do you know \Nabout the Gyoza Prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.23,0:19:02.74,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Prince? Not King?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.74,0:19:03.45,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Yeah, Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.66,0:19:13.00,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Gotcha. Just kiddin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.25,0:19:14.43,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh? Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.43,0:19:16.83,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,What kind of joke is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.83,0:19:19.02,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Well, it's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.41,0:19:21.41,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You're avoiding me again, aren't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.27,0:19:26.18,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm not necessarily... avoiding you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.97,0:19:29.43,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,More like, there's no way I can \Nlook at you in the eye
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.43,0:19:32.48,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,after what happened yesterday!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.88,0:19:42.41,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.20,0:19:45.16,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You had a hair...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.16,0:19:48.81,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,What did I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.95,0:19:51.92,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Did you think I was \Ngoing to try to kiss you again?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.36,0:19:55.39,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Relax. I won't do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.94,0:19:56.89,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I told you, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.89,0:19:59.34,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I won't do anything that you don't like.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.91,0:20:01.69,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Don't like?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.31,0:20:06.01,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Did I {\i0}not{\i1} like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.79,0:20:09.03,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Yesterday, too. And just now...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.71,0:20:12.73,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.56,0:20:19.11,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Well, I'm gonna head out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.86,0:20:25.70,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.23,0:20:31.46,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I didn't necessarily...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.16,0:20:34.15,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.71,0:20:37.97,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Yoi-chan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.10,0:20:43.49,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Huh? She said she was going to \Nwait for us in the courtyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.49,0:20:44.72,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Where did she go?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.06,0:20:47.79,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.32,0:20:56.06,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Oh, there she is! Yoi-cha—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.06,0:20:58.27,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Huh? Hey, what's wrong?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.27,0:20:59.89,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Are you feeling sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.70,0:21:03.03,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,For a moment, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.21,0:21:10.47,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,For a {\i0}brief{\i1} moment, I had my hopes \Nup somewhere deep within my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.69,0:21:22.19,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,All she did was hold \Nme back from going, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.35,0:21:31.56,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Whoa. What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.32,0:21:35.55,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,My heart's out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.03,0:21:41.08,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I feel like some kind of emotion \Nthat the eye cannot see
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.54,0:21:44.53,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,is gradually changing me.
