Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.05,0:23:31.55,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\c&H020507&\bord0\b1\fs32\frz15.12\pos(380.667,138)}Hiring Part-timer
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.05,0:23:31.55,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\c&H020507&\bord0\b1\fs24\frz16.76\pos(436.667,268.667)}Telephone number
Dialogue: 1,0:23:29.48,0:23:31.55,Default,TAKUTO,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry to bother \Nyou when you're so busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.29,0:23:35.08,Default,TAKUTO,0,0,0,,I called after seeing your flyer\Nfor a part-time job.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.02,0:23:37.67,Default,TAKUTO,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.52,0:23:41.45,Default,TAKUTO,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.45,0:23:42.44,Default,TAKUTO,0,0,0,,It's Oji.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.81,0:23:45.40,Default,TAKUTO,0,0,0,,My name is Takuto Oji.
